# vsce packaging rules (linux-x64 variant) — WHITELIST style.
# Everything is denied by the leading "**"; only explicitly re-included
# ("!") entries ship. Note on vsce semantics: a file ships if ANY "!"
# rule matches it, regardless of position, so re-inclusions must be
# narrow — exact file names or "*.json" — never whole directories,
# or unwanted siblings (.map, *.yaml, ...) would ship too.
#
# The linux-x64 marketplace package bundles server/linux-x64/llg_ls (the
# "!server/linux-x64/llg_ls" line below).

**

# Manifest, docs and license (package.json/README.md are also force-
# included by vsce itself; LICENSE is renamed to LICENSE.txt at pack time)
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE

# Vite bundle + its generated license notice (no .map)
!dist/extension.js
!dist/extension.js.LICENSE.txt

# Staged llg language-server binary (linux-x64 only)
!server/linux-x64/llg_ls

# Example llg config and schema referenced by the packaged README
!doc/llg.example.toml
!schemas/llg.schema.json

# Grammar/language-configuration JSON build products only (no *.yaml sources)
!syntaxes/**/*.json
!snippets/**/*.json

# Activity-bar icon of the HDL Modules view container (exact file, nothing
# else from media/)
!media/hdl-modules.svg

# Marketplace/extension icon (manifest "icon" must be PNG; the SVG stays source-only)
!media/icon.png

# Tcl/SDC/XDC language server
!server/linux-x64/softbrush_ls
